  "_about": "The Base: a campfire camp on the battle floors' flagstones (systems/campArt.js draws it, scenes/BaseScene.js shows it). pixel = screen pixels per art pixel. room = the floor: drawn with a wall wallArt art px tall, then the wall (+cutBelow rows) cut off, so the top is open floor (the way deeper). light = the campfire (art px): a dark layer over the room, see-through near the fire in solid rings (steps); ambient = how bright the far corners stay. Props (rows like roomProps) are tinted by the light where they stand; propOutline false = props drawn without their dark outer line (user). lit = not tinted (it makes its own light), glow = a soft flickering light round art pixel (x, y) of the prop (the brazier) (r art px, steps rings). place = [prop, x, y, flip] in SCREEN px (bottom centre). hero = the 3 heroes idling round the fire. npcs = the old camp NPCs (not drawn since the menu rework of 2026-10-21; kept for the screens behind the buttons).",
